{
 "total": 240.014,
 "lines": [
  {
   "scene": "1.1",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 0.72,
   "sp": 5.441,
   "t1": 5.841,
   "text": "Service history is usually scattered across workshops and paper receipts.",
   "file": "vo/lines/1.1_0.wav",
   "i0": 1089,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "1.1",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 5.841,
   "sp": 8.352,
   "t1": 8.752,
   "text": "RevLog keeps one record for every bike.",
   "file": "vo/lines/1.1_1.wav",
   "i0": 814,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "1.1",
   "n": 2,
   "t0": 8.752,
   "sp": 12.649,
   "t1": 13.049,
   "text": "The Rider owns it, and workshops add to it with the Rider's approval.",
   "file": "vo/lines/1.1_2.wav",
   "i0": 1642,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "1.1",
   "n": 3,
   "t0": 13.049,
   "sp": 15.427,
   "t1": 15.827,
   "text": "A bike with no owner yet can be served too.",
   "file": "vo/lines/1.1_3.wav",
   "i0": 2543,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "2.1",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 16.247,
   "sp": 19.373,
   "t1": 19.773,
   "text": "First, pick one: I ride, or I run a workshop.",
   "file": "vo/lines/2.1_0.wav",
   "i0": 868,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "2.1",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 19.773,
   "sp": 21.671,
   "t1": 22.071,
   "text": "Then sign in with Google or email.",
   "file": "vo/lines/2.1_1.wav",
   "i0": 2146,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "2.2",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 22.191,
   "sp": 23.379,
   "t1": 23.779,
   "text": "There are four roles.",
   "file": "vo/lines/2.2_0.wav",
   "i0": 1605,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "2.2",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 23.779,
   "sp": 25.326,
   "t1": 25.726,
   "text": "The Rider owns the record.",
   "file": "vo/lines/2.2_1.wav",
   "i0": 1891,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "2.2",
   "n": 2,
   "t0": 25.726,
   "sp": 27.797,
   "t1": 28.197,
   "text": "The Workshop owner runs the workshop.",
   "file": "vo/lines/2.2_2.wav",
   "i0": 1618,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "2.2",
   "n": 3,
   "t0": 28.197,
   "sp": 29.684,
   "t1": 30.084,
   "text": "Staff save each service.",
   "file": "vo/lines/2.2_3.wav",
   "i0": 699,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "2.2",
   "n": 4,
   "t0": 30.084,
   "sp": 32.934,
   "t1": 33.334,
   "text": "And the Admin approves workshops and checks ownership.",
   "file": "vo/lines/2.2_4.wav",
   "i0": 1095,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.1",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 33.754,
   "sp": 37.427,
   "t1": 37.827,
   "text": "A Rider finds their bike, then adds the odometer and plate.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.1_0.wav",
   "i0": 2019,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.2",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 37.947,
   "sp": 41.054,
   "t1": 41.454,
   "text": "Two quick questions help RevLog tell you what's due.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.2_0.wav",
   "i0": 995,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.2",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 41.454,
   "sp": 42.792,
   "t1": 43.192,
   "text": "A short guide follows.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.2_1.wav",
   "i0": 2432,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.2",
   "n": 2,
   "t0": 43.192,
   "sp": 45.85,
   "t1": 46.25,
   "text": "Then the Rider agrees to how their data is used.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.2_2.wav",
   "i0": 1005,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.3",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 46.37,
   "sp": 48.069,
   "t1": 48.469,
   "text": "The bike is now in the Garage.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.3_0.wav",
   "i0": 1593,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.3",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 48.469,
   "sp": 51.897,
   "t1": 52.297,
   "text": "Below it: Log service, Verify this bike, and What's due.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.3_1.wav",
   "i0": 2404,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.4",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 52.417,
   "sp": 57.099,
   "t1": 57.499,
   "text": "Verify this bike asks for photos of your driving licence and geran.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.4_0.wav",
   "i0": 909,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.4",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 57.499,
   "sp": 59.091,
   "t1": 61.099,
   "text": "They prove the bike is yours.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.4_1.wav",
   "i0": 1295,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.4",
   "n": 2,
   "t0": 61.099,
   "sp": 66.956,
   "t1": 67.356,
   "text": "Document photos are deleted after the check, or kept up to 14 days if checked by hand.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.4_2.wav",
   "i0": 638,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.4",
   "n": 3,
   "t0": 67.356,
   "sp": 72.849,
   "t1": 73.249,
   "text": "Once the bike is verified, My code becomes available. We'll see the Admin's check later.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.4_3.wav",
   "i0": 784,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.5",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 73.369,
   "sp": 77.482,
   "t1": 77.882,
   "text": "What's due lists every item. Tap one to see how far it has left.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.5_0.wav",
   "i0": 1207,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.6",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 78.002,
   "sp": 80.015,
   "t1": 80.415,
   "text": "Log service records your own work.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.6_0.wav",
   "i0": 1346,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.6",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 80.415,
   "sp": 84.41,
   "t1": 84.81,
   "text": "It appears in History as a Rider entry, with its details.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.6_1.wav",
   "i0": 981,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.7",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 84.93,
   "sp": 87.53,
   "t1": 87.93,
   "text": "Fuel tracks fill-ups and kilometres per litre.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.7_0.wav",
   "i0": 1357,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "3.8",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 88.05,
   "sp": 91.445,
   "t1": 91.845,
   "text": "Plus a service schedule, renewal reminders, and spending.",
   "file": "vo/lines/3.8_0.wav",
   "i0": 908,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "4.1",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 92.265,
   "sp": 94.677,
   "t1": 95.077,
   "text": "A Workshop owner registers the workshop.",
   "file": "vo/lines/4.1_0.wav",
   "i0": 1649,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "4.1",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 95.077,
   "sp": 98.521,
   "t1": 98.921,
   "text": "RevLog checks every workshop before it can search bikes.",
   "file": "vo/lines/4.1_1.wav",
   "i0": 850,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "4.2",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 99.041,
   "sp": 100.346,
   "t1": 100.746,
   "text": "The Admin approves it,",
   "file": "vo/lines/4.2_0.wav",
   "i0": 1460,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "4.2",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 100.746,
   "sp": 102.981,
   "t1": 103.381,
   "text": "and now the workshop can search by plate.",
   "file": "vo/lines/4.2_1.wav",
   "i0": 1436,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "4.3",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 103.501,
   "sp": 107.254,
   "t1": 107.654,
   "text": "Workshop mode has Search, Customers, Packages and Team.",
   "file": "vo/lines/4.3_0.wav",
   "i0": 1197,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "4.3",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 107.654,
   "sp": 111.602,
   "t1": 112.002,
   "text": "Packages save the usual items and costs, ready in one tap.",
   "file": "vo/lines/4.3_1.wav",
   "i0": 826,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "4.4",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 112.122,
   "sp": 114.467,
   "t1": 114.867,
   "text": "Under Team, the owner adds Branches.",
   "file": "vo/lines/4.4_0.wav",
   "i0": 1983,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "4.4",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 114.867,
   "sp": 116.764,
   "t1": 117.164,
   "text": "The Free plan allows one Branch.",
   "file": "vo/lines/4.4_1.wav",
   "i0": 2155,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "4.5",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 117.284,
   "sp": 121.394,
   "t1": 121.794,
   "text": "The owner creates an invite code, and a Staff member joins with it.",
   "file": "vo/lines/4.5_0.wav",
   "i0": 1059,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "4.5",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 121.794,
   "sp": 124.506,
   "t1": 124.906,
   "text": "The Free plan limits how many staff you can add.",
   "file": "vo/lines/4.5_1.wav",
   "i0": 1002,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "5.1",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 125.326,
   "sp": 128.156,
   "t1": 128.556,
   "text": "Now, a workshop visit. Staff search the plate.",
   "file": "vo/lines/5.1_0.wav",
   "i0": 1218,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "5.1",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 128.556,
   "sp": 131.419,
   "t1": 131.819,
   "text": "The bike belongs to a Rider: Approval needed.",
   "file": "vo/lines/5.1_1.wav",
   "i0": 1255,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "5.2",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 131.939,
   "sp": 138.4,
   "t1": 138.8,
   "text": "The Rider opens My code: a QR and a 6-digit code, valid for ten minutes, used once.",
   "file": "vo/lines/5.2_0.wav",
   "i0": 1490,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "5.3",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 138.92,
   "sp": 139.902,
   "t1": 142.12,
   "text": "Staff scan it,",
   "file": "vo/lines/5.3_0.wav",
   "i0": 843,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "5.3",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 142.12,
   "sp": 143.787,
   "t1": 144.187,
   "text": "or type the code and tap Done.",
   "file": "vo/lines/5.3_1.wav",
   "i0": 1977,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "5.4",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 144.307,
   "sp": 148.368,
   "t1": 148.768,
   "text": "The bike opens, with the Rider's first name and the workshop's record.",
   "file": "vo/lines/5.4_0.wav",
   "i0": 1095,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "5.5",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 148.888,
   "sp": 153.146,
   "t1": 153.546,
   "text": "In the Rider's History, the workshop's record appears with the Workshop badge.",
   "file": "vo/lines/5.5_0.wav",
   "i0": 716,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "5.5",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 153.546,
   "sp": 154.947,
   "t1": 155.347,
   "text": "The Rider typed nothing.",
   "file": "vo/lines/5.5_1.wav",
   "i0": 1298,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "6.1",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 155.767,
   "sp": 160.618,
   "t1": 161.018,
   "text": "A plate not in the system? Staff tap Add this bike, with its brand and model.",
   "file": "vo/lines/6.1_0.wav",
   "i0": 1039,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "6.2",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 161.138,
   "sp": 164.56,
   "t1": 164.96,
   "text": "Then a package, the odometer and costs, and Save record.",
   "file": "vo/lines/6.2_0.wav",
   "i0": 1660,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "6.3",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 165.08,
   "sp": 169.196,
   "t1": 169.596,
   "text": "The record carries the workshop's stamp, and Staff show the Claim QR.",
   "file": "vo/lines/6.3_0.wav",
   "i0": 1191,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "6.4",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 169.716,
   "sp": 171.613,
   "t1": 173.516,
   "text": "The Rider scans the Claim QR,",
   "file": "vo/lines/6.4_0.wav",
   "i0": 1634,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "6.4",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 173.516,
   "sp": 175.108,
   "t1": 176.716,
   "text": "and photographs the geran.",
   "file": "vo/lines/6.4_1.wav",
   "i0": 1460,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "6.4",
   "n": 2,
   "t0": 176.716,
   "sp": 181.157,
   "t1": 181.557,
   "text": "Once ownership is confirmed, the bike and the workshop's records are theirs.",
   "file": "vo/lines/6.4_2.wav",
   "i0": 1154,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "7.1",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 181.977,
   "sp": 186.619,
   "t1": 187.019,
   "text": "The Rider sees which workshops have access, and can remove one at any time.",
   "file": "vo/lines/7.1_0.wav",
   "i0": 1152,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "7.2",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 187.139,
   "sp": 188.466,
   "t1": 188.866,
   "text": "There are two ways to sell.",
   "file": "vo/lines/7.2_0.wav",
   "i0": 1710,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "7.2",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 188.866,
   "sp": 193.157,
   "t1": 193.557,
   "text": "Sell to a RevLog rider: the seller types the buyer's Receive code.",
   "file": "vo/lines/7.2_1.wav",
   "i0": 882,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "7.2",
   "n": 2,
   "t0": 193.557,
   "sp": 198.209,
   "t1": 198.609,
   "text": "Or Transfer to a buyer: a locked file, opened with a 6-digit code.",
   "file": "vo/lines/7.2_2.wav",
   "i0": 1971,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "8.1",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 199.029,
   "sp": 202.12,
   "t1": 202.52,
   "text": "A bike checked by hand waits as not yet verified.",
   "file": "vo/lines/8.1_0.wav",
   "i0": 1489,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "8.2",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 202.64,
   "sp": 206.399,
   "t1": 206.799,
   "text": "The Admin opens the case, compares the names, and approves it.",
   "file": "vo/lines/8.2_0.wav",
   "i0": 1352,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "8.3",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 206.919,
   "sp": 210.648,
   "t1": 212.119,
   "text": "After approval, My code appears where Verify this bike was.",
   "file": "vo/lines/8.3_0.wav",
   "i0": 1119,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "8.4",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 212.239,
   "sp": 217.921,
   "t1": 218.321,
   "text": "The Admin also sets plans and limits: on the Free plan, 30 bikes and one Branch.",
   "file": "vo/lines/8.4_0.wav",
   "i0": 1422,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "9.1",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 218.741,
   "sp": 221.743,
   "t1": 222.143,
   "text": "A workshop sees your bike only after you approve it.",
   "file": "vo/lines/9.1_0.wav",
   "i0": 2031,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "9.2",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 222.263,
   "sp": 222.263,
   "t1": 224.063,
   "text": "",
   "file": null,
   "i0": null,
   "sr": null
  },
  {
   "scene": "9.3",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 224.183,
   "sp": 230.04,
   "t1": 230.44,
   "text": "Document photos are deleted after the check, or kept up to 14 days if checked by hand.",
   "file": "vo/lines/9.3_0.wav",
   "i0": 638,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "10.1",
   "n": 0,
   "t0": 230.86,
   "sp": 236.956,
   "t1": 237.356,
   "text": "One record for every bike: owned by the Rider, added to by workshops, checked by the Admin.",
   "file": "vo/lines/10.1_0.wav",
   "i0": 940,
   "sr": 24000
  },
  {
   "scene": "10.1",
   "n": 1,
   "t0": 237.356,
   "sp": 238.114,
   "t1": 238.514,
   "text": "RevLog.",
   "file": "vo/lines/10.1_1.wav",
   "i0": 581,
   "sr": 24000
  }
